  "summary": "Full-stack engineer with 16+ years building production software, now focused on AI: autonomous agents, the agentic web, and the tooling that drives them. I take AI products from idea to production, end to end.\nRecent work:\n\n• Delphy (delphy.network): an @identity platform for the agentic web. Any business, person, or service gets a machine-readable identity that AI agents can discover and act on, no scraping. Live, with a published MCP server.\n\n• Delphy Agent: a desktop hub that drives 8 LLM providers and agent CLIs through one interface, extended with MCP plugins.\n\n• AstraNova + Astra CLI: a 24/7 living market simulation run by 12 AI agents, plus an open-source CLI to deploy any LLM as an agent.\n\nI work deep with the Model Context Protocol, building both MCP servers and clients, and lean hard on modern AI tooling (Claude Code, Codex) to ship fast and own the whole stack.\n\nStack: TypeScript, Node.js, React, Next.js, Python, Rust, PostgreSQL, Supabase, AWS (ECS Fargate, CDK, Lambda, S3, RDS), Docker, Solana, Internet Computer, Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, Vercel AI SDK, RAG, MCP.\nOpen to full-time roles and freelance/contract work building AI-powered products, especially with teams and startups moving fast with modern tooling.\n\nBuilding in public at fermartz.com",
